message: "If you use Bharat-Tiny-LLM v4.0 or BharatBench-Voice, cite this release."
title: "Bharat-Tiny-LLM v4.0: A Safety-First Offline Hinglish Answer System"
version: 4.0.2
date-released: 2026-11-12
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/eulogik/Bharat-Tiny-LLM"
