  - qwen3.5
abstract: >-
  Bharat-Tiny-LLM v4.0 is an offline Hinglish/Hindi/English assistant built on
  stock Qwen3.5-2B with 13 fixed health protocols, 131 vetted answer cards, a
  domain router and safety guards. Health and matched cards never call the
  model. On the 200-prompt BharatBench-Voice benchmark the system reaches 100%
  language match, safety, live-data honesty and math with zero model calls.
